{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memories, no name, and no clear way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are inside the <strong>Vitromotus</strong>, a vast underground world created as a magical prison. It was meant to hold criminals and outcasts. but over the centuries it became something else entirely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villages formed. Factions rose and fell and death itself lost its meaning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Above the depths lies <strong>Emberville</strong>, a town built around the crystal that anchors the Vitromotus to the surface. Once inhabited, it now stands silent, its people scattered, imprisoned, or lost below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuilding Emberville</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue survivors trapped within the Vitromotus and bring them back to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each returned townsperson restores part of Emberville, unlocks new mechanics, crafting and progression systems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the town grows, it becomes a living hub shaped by <strong>your</strong> actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Vitromotus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Vitromotus is not a maze. It is a living world shaped by the influence of kymia, an energy that resurrects the dead, warps the land, and reshapes those who dwell within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore layered regions filled with ruins, survivor settlements, hostile creatures, and warped environments influenced by <strong>kymia</strong>, a mysterious energy born from emotion, suffering, and conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of kymia, death is temporary, but its effects on the mind and body are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden lore, forgotten histories, and the truth behind the prison as you push deeper into its world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in action focused combat that rewards positioning, timing, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from distinct class paths and combat styles, each offering unique abilities and progression options. Develop your character through meaningful upgrades and experiment with builds that fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow more dangerous the deeper you venture. Survival demands preparation and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting, Building, and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials from ruins, enemies, and the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons, armor, tools, furniture, and structures to aid your survival. Build your own base, expand Emberville, and unlock deeper systems as more people and knowledge return to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is tied not only to combat, but to exploration, rebuilding, and the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2295170?t=1767383268","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295170/7690f918427a31bcb97640009af9f85679cdc8aa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767383268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295170/2b15e8d375868d252e49187e73724f9a4fdee77b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767383268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295170/2b15e8d375868d252e49187e73724f9a4fdee77b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767383268","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memories, no name, and no clear way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are inside the <strong>Vitromotus</strong>, a vast underground world created as a magical prison. It was meant to hold criminals and outcasts. but over the centuries it became something else entirely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villages formed. Factions rose and fell and death itself lost its meaning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Above the depths lies <strong>Emberville</strong>, a town built around the crystal that anchors the Vitromotus to the surface. Once inhabited, it now stands silent, its people scattered, imprisoned, or lost below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuilding Emberville</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue survivors trapped within the Vitromotus and bring them back to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each returned townsperson restores part of Emberville, unlocks new mechanics, crafting and progression systems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the town grows, it becomes a living hub shaped by <strong>your</strong> actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Vitromotus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Vitromotus is not a maze. It is a living world shaped by the influence of kymia, an energy that resurrects the dead, warps the land, and reshapes those who dwell within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore layered regions filled with ruins, survivor settlements, hostile creatures, and warped environments influenced by <strong>kymia</strong>, a mysterious energy born from emotion, suffering, and conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of kymia, death is temporary, but its effects on the mind and body are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden lore, forgotten histories, and the truth behind the prison as you push deeper into its world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in action focused combat that rewards positioning, timing, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from distinct class paths and combat styles, each offering unique abilities and progression options. Develop your character through meaningful upgrades and experiment with builds that fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow more dangerous the deeper you venture. Survival demands preparation and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting, Building, and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials from ruins, enemies, and the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons, armor, tools, furniture, and structures to aid your survival. Build your own base, expand Emberville, and unlock deeper systems as more people and knowledge return to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is tied not only to combat, but to exploration, rebuilding, and the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Cygnus Cross"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295170/9f52c3db6057be3cecb2eb56716f44b4420fe1d0/header.jpg?t=1767383268","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Cygnus Cross International 2026","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Emberville","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3210 3.2 GHz / AMD A8-7600 APU 3.1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce 400 Series / AMD Radeon HD 7000 series with OpenGL 4.4<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Cygnus Cross"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nDrogas l\u00edcitas\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295170/8b45cfe19867c9d7f724e0f355c5cec2a125180b/ss_8b45cfe19867c9d7f724e0f355c5cec2a125180b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767383268","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295170/8b45cfe19867c9d7f724e0f355c5cec2a125180b/ss_8b45cfe19867c9d7f724e0f355c5cec2a125180b.600x338.jpg?t=1767383268"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295170/ad2d7ca30c18ae7dfc63db22cf93002655eaa6f4/ss_ad2d7ca30c18ae7dfc63db22cf93002655eaa6f4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767383268","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295170/ad2d7ca30c18ae7dfc63